  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Introducing processing and export of layer hens to the Palestinian Territories</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Currently, between 6,000,000 and 7,500,000 off laying hens are being freed on the streets, burnt or dumped in holes in the ground annually in the Palestinian Territories and Israel.The partners have the intention to create value from off laying hens by establishing the first slaughterhouse for layer hens in the Palestinian Territories and export the frozen meat to Africa and Asia.The applicant, the Israeli company Natshe Li El Doyagen Ltd. is specialised in slaughtering broilers and selling all types of meat to consumers in Jerusalem.The local partner, World Classic Company is an exporter of frozen chicken feet for retailers in Africa. M.S.H. Ltd, an Israeli consulting company, will assist the consortium in the international logistics and the marketing and sales in Africa and Asia.</narrative>
  </description>
